         ->  Dynamic Seq Scan on part_web  (cost=0.00..431.07 rows=3334 width=8)
               Number of partitions to scan: 2 (out of 3)
         ->  Redistribute Motion 1:3  (slice2)  (cost=0.00..487.55 rows=333334 width=8)
               ->  Dynamic Foreign Scan on part_web  (cost=0.00..451.90 rows=1000000 width=8)
